# Rover 200 R3 (three-door hatchback), 1995-1999.
#
# The R3 was the October 1995 Rover 200: a shortened HH-R 400 on a 120 mm shorter
# wheelbase, sold as three- and five-door hatchbacks as the replacement for the R8
# 200. The three-door is modelled, because that is the body the reference
# photographs show; the door count is invisible at 128 px, but the long single door
# and the fixed rear-quarter glass do show on the flank.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rover_200_/_25
# https://rover200.org.uk/cars/r3/r3-history
#
# Dimensions 3.970 x 1.690 x 1.420 m, wheelbase 2.500 m; the published R3 dimension
# box. Against the HH-R that is 350 mm shorter, 5 mm narrower, 30 mm taller and
# 120 mm less wheelbase. Mirrors take the modelled width to 1.946 m.
#
# Colours: Nightfire Red, Silver Leaf metallic, White Gold and Tahiti Blue, the same
# Rover UK range as the HH-R. DVSA first-registration shares are measured for these
# years, so no era adjustment is needed: red 4, silver 4, white 3, blue 2.
# Total 13. Provisional pending the central rebase.
#
# Speed 175 km/h, a step below the HH-R because the R3 was a lighter car with the
# smaller engine range. Comfort 90/315, on the line 180 + 1.5 x 90, a step below the
# HH-R's 92/320 and equal to the R8 200 hatchback, whose platform it developed.
# Classes 0,1,2: the R3 was the mainstream supermini of the Rover range.
#
# Dates are road presence, not production: October 1995 intro, retires staggered
# 2008-2012 on a thirteen- to seventeen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/rover-200-r3.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/rover-200-r3.dae (67 objects). Variant of the Rover 400 HH-R master;
# references: citycars/references/rover-200-r3/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons,
# CC BY 3.0).
#
# Accepted low-poly deviations, recorded rather than corrected: the compound curves
# are angular low-poly approximations, and the rear lamps are the triangular hatch
# units the photographs show rather than the HH-R saloon's taller, narrower units.

obj=citycar
name=Rover200R3(NightfireRed)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=4
intro_year=1995
intro_month=10
retire_year=2010
retire_month=6
speed=175
class=0,1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=90
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=315

Image[E]=./images/rover-200-r3-red_E.0.0,-33,14
Image[SE]=./images/rover-200-r3-red_SE.0.0,-13,0
